environment:

    dimensions (list/array): Room L, W, H. (Fallback: config.env.room_dim)

    wall_resolution (int or list): Discretization grid. (Fallback: config.env.wall_resolution)

    reflectivity (dict): floor, ceiling, walls. (Fallback: config.env.reflectivity)

    special_surfaces (list of dicts): Add RIS or window objects defining center, dims, const_axis, resolution, normal, reflectivity, name, and sun_power.

    blockers: Reserved key, currently passes None.

    nodes (Contains masters, sensors, ambient_nodes):

    positions (array): The only strictly required parameter.

    nT, nR: Transmit/Receive normals. (Fallback: -z for masters, +z for sensors)

    rx_area, FOV, m (Lambertian order). (Fallback: config.env values)

    tx_power, IR_tx_power, RF_tx_power. (Fallback: config.comm / config.devices)

    rx_type (0=PD, 1=PV) and uplink_type (0=IR, 1=RF).

    sensitivity, VLC_pass_filter, IR_pass_filter.

energy_profile -> communication:

    Rb_down, Rb_up, n_sp_d, n_sp_u (bitrates and filter spans). (Fallback: config.comm)

    TIA:

    Top-level dictionary for TIA electrical noise parameters (RF, CF, Vn, In, etc.). (Fallback: config.devices.tia)

    PV_circuit:

    Top-level dictionary for PV harvesting physics (Voc, Jsc, Rs, Rsh, etc.). (Fallback: config.devices.pv_circuit)


